{"id":"b4bbd4adcc87a316","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-derived-functor.md","title":"Derived Functor","display":"df-derived-functor — Derived Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-derived-functor","aliases":["58-df-derived-functor"],"display":"df-derived-functor — Derived Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-derived-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-derived-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derived-functor — Derived Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cbc1735835617989\" href=\"?note=cbc1735835617989\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md\">../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S,\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S,\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 使用依赖文件中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 均由 58 内部的范畴分解与核余核定义给出，不是自由的原语。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span> 是六元范畴代码的对象集合投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S(\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\n(P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\n(Q_\\bullet,\\partial,F,P_\\bullet,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S(H,n,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(D,H,\\mathcal B)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S(\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\n(P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\n(Q_\\bullet,\\partial,F,P_\\bullet,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S(H,n,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(D,H,\\mathcal B)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原来已经显式给出的左导出值关系保持不变；本次补齐其调用的数学定义及依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0F\\cong F\">\\(L_0F\\cong F\\)</span> 另需右正合性；本定义不擅自把原有的可加函子条件改成右正合。</li>\n<li>投射分解不被要求在每个次数同时截断，同调输出仍按目标范畴中的同构解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md","status":"resolved","id":"cbc1735835617989","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S,\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n&\\mathrm{LeftDerivedValue}_S(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S(\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S\n(P_\\bullet,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S\n(Q_\\bullet,\\partial,F,P_\\bullet,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S(H,n,Q_\\bullet,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(D,H,\\mathcal B)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L_0F\\cong F","display":false}],"bytes":2304,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-417","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-derived-functor.md|58-df-derived-functor]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","cbc1735835617989","e637becf421e4e61","2aed7ac2ed3313e0"]}